  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">The Climate Promise 2 will support the NDC implementation in the following ways:a) Strengthening the integration of gender and social inclusion into the NDC implementation plan b) Building synergies among the existing climate policies and plans and reinforcing climate action integration into the national and sub-national development plansc) Developing long-term climate action visiond) Building the institutional capacity of the key government agencies on climate actione) Improving coordination a</narrative>
